{"id":"en_my-lion-king-s-prisoner","title":"My Lion King’s Prisoner","titleEn":"My Lion King’s Prisoner","description":"Evan, a young white man, is suddenly pulled into a brutal continent inhabited by beastmen, where Kellen, the lion king, takes him captive. Though Evan tries repeatedly to break free, every attempt fails, and over time he is touched by the intense yet gentle care Kellen shows him. Ultimately, Evan gives up the chance to return to his own world, and the two of them defy the boundaries between their kinds to become lifelong companions, jointly governing the lion tribe.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/my-lion-kings-prisoner/en_US/4c70d875c2df60ab/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/my-lion-kings-prisoner/en_US/4c70d875c2df60ab/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["LGBT+","Royalty","Hybrid","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dt4bu/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_my-lion-king-s-prisoner_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dt4bu/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_my-lion-king-s-prisoner_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dt4bu/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_my-lion-king-s-prisoner_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dt4bu/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_my-lion-king-s-prisoner_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dt4bu/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_my-lion-king-s-prisoner_5","